From 02564a72155131070190d1fa42ed558b4d897188 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mbadusha <mbadusha@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 09:53:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Description] : Adds Device.Firewall.X_QCOM.PacketStats object with writable Enable and Reset controls in TR-181 XML.
Packet statistics behavior lacked a formal DM control interface, causing inconsistent operational enable/reset management.
There was no single managed path to trigger backend reset/restart flows from configuration changes.

[Fix Description]:
Adds CosaDmlGet/SetPacketStatsEnable and CosaDmlGet/SetPacketStatsReset plus DML glue functions.
Persists values via syscfg/sysevent and triggers reset-time backend refresh through firewall restart path.

Signed-off-by: mbadusha <mbadusha@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 config-arm/TR181-USGv2.XML                    |  27 +-
 .../TR-181/board_sbapi/cosa_firewall_apis.c   | 182 ++++++++++++-
 .../middle_layer_src/cosa_firewall_dml.c      | 239 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../middle_layer_src/cosa_firewall_dml.h      |  49 ++++
 4 files changed, 495 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

